# Spec Kit verifies its managed files by SHA-256 of the LF content it wrote.
# With core.autocrlf=true those files check out as CRLF and every one reports
# as "modified". Keep agent tooling LF in the working tree; text=auto leaves
# binary files untouched.
.specify/** text=auto eol=lf
.agents/** text=auto eol=lf
